/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/T (The Tool Management System \(TMS\) is designed to simplify inventory management for tools. This system facilitates functionalities like adding, borrowing, returning, and maintaining tools, providing an efficient workflow for administrators and end-users such as faculty and students. Built with SQLite for local storage and a Python or Java-based interface, the TMS emphasizes functionality, offline usability, and simplicity.)
/E (The Tool Management System \(TMS\) is designed to simplify inventory management for tools. This system facilitates functionalities like adding, borrowing, returning, and maintaining tools, providing an efficient workflow for administrators and end-users such as faculty and students. Built with SQLite for local storage and a Python or Java-based interface, the TMS emphasizes functionality, offline usability, and simplicity.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [6]
>>
